This product can also use the "Nemotron Streaming Persian" automatic
speech recognition model (sherpa-onnx int8 export, downloaded on demand,
not bundled), a Persian fine-tune by mallahyari / mehdi-hf of NVIDIA's
nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-0.6b architecture, licensed under OpenMDW 1.1.
No model weights are redistributed by this project; they are downloaded
directly from the sources below.

  Fine-tuned model (source fine-tune):
    https://huggingface.co/mehdi-hf/nemotron-asr-streaming-farsi

  ONNX export used by this app:
    https://huggingface.co/Nimaone/nemotron-asr-streaming-farsi-onnx

